Sessions and their related data 

``` yaml
sessions-v3:
    $sid:
        hostUID: uid
        active: boolean
        info: object
        updates: object
        iceServers: object
        requests: object
        participants: object


session-data: 
    $sid:
        $feature-name: any
        logs: object


users:
    $uid:
        session-history:
            $sid: 
                startTime: number
                duration: number
                info: object
```